  "totalBlocks": 18,
  "translatedBlocks": 18,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0020d01aa612e616",
      "translationZh": "我看到很多帖子都称赞 Fixed 模板和 Sharp 模板比默认模板更好，于是便对它们进行了测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63418d592fe1740d",
      "translationZh": "测试的全面程度还达不到论文级分析应有的水平，但足以体现各个模板的特点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9248097b0432ab59",
      "translationZh": "我使用了 SWE-bench Verified 和 mini-SWE-agent 2.4.6，切片范围为 0:100（所有运行均使用完全相同的 100 个任务）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0160a946158de93f",
      "translationZh": "我将 jpezzulli/sglang-rtxpro6000 容器化，并在 CUDA 13.3 上使用 RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 运行 Flash Next。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3258116ad0848515",
      "translationZh": "51.2 GB 的 FP8 n-gram 嵌入表，锁定在 RAM 中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e35fa60b749b0ca",
      "translationZh": "32 GB 的 HiCache，锁定在 RAM 中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "090ed42e2b17715d",
      "translationZh": "我在 medium 和 xhigh 两种推理强度下运行了所有模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb723adeb143bfdc",
      "translationZh": "指标 Stock（medium） Stock（xhigh） Stock Δ Fixed（medium） Fixed（xhigh） Fixed Δ Sharp（medium） Sharp（xhigh） Sharp Δ",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a19c9d7e77adba7f",
      "translationZh": "将推理强度提高到 xhigh，几乎消除了 stock 和 fixed 相对于 Sharp 的全部差距。在 medium 下，Sharp 的解决任务数比 stock 多 +3 个，比 fixed 多 +7 个；而在 xhigh 下，stock 和 fixed 的解决任务数反而分别比 Sharp 多 +5 个和 +4 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74a7fb3981ea2cdc",
      "translationZh": "尽管 token 和时间成本确实增加了，Sharp 的解决任务数几乎没有变化（94 → 94）：推理 token 数的中位数上升了 +46.5%，实际耗时的中位数上升了 +53.4%。这表明，在 medium 下，它已经获得了额外推理预算所能带来的大部分收益，而 stock 和 fixed 仍有提升空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edeed25f0b2cb437",
      "translationZh": "在 xhigh 下，Sharp 仍然是每个已解决任务消耗 token 最少的模板（每个已解决任务消耗 14,541 个输出 token，而 stock/fixed 约为 ~17,000 个），这与它在 medium 下的效率优势一致；但当推理强度较高时，它不再是解决任务数最多的模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c1a88648f7c670f",
      "translationZh": "绝对成本随推理强度大幅增长：stock/fixed 的总实际耗时约增至 2.3–2.5×，Sharp 则增加了 +28%；stock/fixed 的推理 token 总数大约翻倍，Sharp 则增加了 +35%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5434513283cd25f9",
      "translationZh": "Sharp 应该在 medium 下使用，它能以非常好的速度保持合理的准确率。我看不出在 xhigh 下使用它有什么意义。牺牲少量准确率，就能用一半的时间完成任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00dc6b0b11f880bd",
      "translationZh": "Stock 最慢，但最准确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d58bc8dcb36418d",
      "translationZh": "无论在准确率还是速度上，Fixed 都介于 Stock 和 Sharp 之间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4bd8ed2170020726",
      "translationZh": "下一次基准测试将采用范围广得多的 SWE-bench Multilingual + Terminal Bench。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccefb428abf43ac8",
      "translationZh": "免责声明：这篇帖子是我自己写的，随后使用 AI 对其进行了适当的排版，以提高可读性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e00b82fc1988326",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/HeDo88TH 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
